WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.310
Is French harder than history?

2
00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:05.150
Here's one opinion: «Le
français est moins difficile que

3
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.950
l'histoire.» French is less
difficult than history.

4
00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:11.920
Comparing looks easy:
a little word for less,

5
00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.420
another for more.

6
00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:15.430
So far, so logical.

7
00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:17.300
Now try good.

8
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.910
This cake is more good than the other one?

9
00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.580
English speakers wince.

10
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.280
We say better.

11
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:24.630
So what about French?

12
00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.730
Does it happily say more good,

13
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:28.880
or does it have the same trap?

14
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:32.580
In this mission, you'll weigh
things up on three balance scales:

15
00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.110
more, less, and equal.

16
00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:37.940
Then you'll build the most
and the least in the lab,

17
00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:39.540
chip by chip.

18
00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:43.650
Your mission: find out whether
French falls into the more good trap.
